    "Details": "The D configuration replaces the weapons loadout of the prime completely; mounted in the center torso are a pair of Micro Pulse Lasers, each arm mounts a single Improved Heavy Medium Laser, and an ATM 12 is mounted in each of the left and right torsos. This configuration also mounts two additional Double Heat Sinks, one in each arm to handle the heat load of the Improved Heavy Lasers.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Protected Actuators</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.09</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
